  "description": "EXACUD crystallizes in the cubic crystal system with space group I -4 3 d. Reported CIF formula moiety: C88 H116 Dy4 N12 Ni4 O24 4+,30.6(H2 O1),4(Cl1 1-),2(C1 H1 Cl3). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Ni1 (Ni) has 3 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Ni2 (Ni) has 3 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Ni3 (Ni) has 3 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Ni4 (Ni) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.215-4.251 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 84.22-138.77°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4Ni4(H3L)4(μ3-OH)4(μ2-OH)4]Cl4·30.6H2O·2CHCl3. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 4 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
